<metadata><name>Galičica trail H-14</name><desc>H-14 is one of Galičica National Park's easier and shorter hiking trails. It's 1.7 km from near St Naum to St Parascheva, with about 16 m of climbing and 5 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 693 m and 708 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/h-14/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
